From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:01:44 +0800
Subject: dmaengine: qcom: gpi: retain rings until channel shutdown is
 confirmed

Rebinding the Piano touchscreen can reuse freed peripheral configuration. Store each channel configuration in the channel, invalidate it on release, and fence callbacks before stopping GPI. Release rings only after the hardware has confirmed shutdown. Retain rings when restart or cleanup cannot be confirmed.

Fixes: 5d0c3533a19f ("dmaengine: qcom: Add GPI dma driver")

Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/19b810da9b9078c5925edb71f6e3a56259bb2f81
Signed-off-by: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
---
